r tile with only 1 unshown copy remaining, making it essentially dead. It cannot form any melds with my current tiles and provides no path to winning patterns. Discarding it maintains my paired tiles (W3-W3, W6-W6) and my bamboo sequence potential (T3, T4, T4, T6), keeping maximum flexibility for drawing completing tiles like T2, T5, or additional W3/W6 for pungs.\n\nAnswer: Play F2"}
